  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Clinch Mountain Backstep (1)**: rare: 11 archived performances [5]\n- **Sweet Revenge**: rare: 4 archived performances [5]\n- **Cold On The Shoulder**: rare: 11 archived performances [5]\n- **Katy Daley**: back after 43 archived shows (417 days) [5]\n- **Morning Light**: rare: 14 archived performances [5]\n- **Loser**: mythic rare: 2 archived performances [5]\n- **Georgia Buck (5)**: back after 51 archived shows (621 days) [5]\n- **Crawdad Hole (5)**: back after 64 archived shows (656 days); rare: 6 archived performances [5]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2021-11-10.AKGCK61.Flac24** (recommended): source not stated; 24 songs; 130 min; rated 5/5 by 1 [1]\n- **billystrings2021-11-10.ShureKSM141.Fuchs.Flac24**: source not stated; 24 songs; 129 min [2]\n- **billystrings2021-11-10.AKGCK61.Flac16**: source not stated; 24 songs; 130 min [3]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2021-11-10.AKGCK61.Flac24**: taped by Rich Stoler; transferred by Rich Stoler; source: AKG CK61 Card Mics w c460b Bodies > TASCAM-DR-100MK3 (24/48kHz) [1]. Also: Transfer chain: SD card to Audacity (slight amplification), then CD Wave, then Foobar2000 for tagging [1]\n- **billystrings2021-11-10.ShureKSM141.Fuchs.Flac24**: taped by Jeff \"Fieldtaper\" Fuchs; transferred by Rich Stoler; source: Shure KSM 141 Mic's > Sound Device Mix-Pre II (32 Bit Float/48) [2]. Also: Transfer: SD card to Audacity (slight amplification, dithered to 24-bit), then CD Wave, then Foobar2000 tagging [2]\n- **billystrings2021-11-10.AKGCK61.Flac16**: taped by Rich Stoler; transferred by Rich Stoler; source: AKG CK61 Card Mics w c460b Bodies > TASCAM-DR-100MK3 (24/48kHz) [3]. Also: Same AKG CK61 and TASCAM DR-100MK3 recording by Rich Stoler, this version dithered down to 16-bit; Transfer: SD card to Audacity (slight amplification, 16-bit dither), then CD Wave, then Foobar2000 tagging [3]",
